  {
    "id": "4110dc4269862349c6bbd10c",
    "path": "parquet::column::page_store::PageKey::new",
    "name": "new",
    "owner": "parquet::column::page_store::PageKey",
    "crate": "parquet",
    "version": "59.3.0",
    "kind": "function",
    "signature": "const fn new(raw: u64) -> Self",
    "docs": "Create a handle wrapping `raw`.\n\nA [`PageStore`] implementation calls this to mint the handle it returns\nfrom [`put`](PageStore::put). The value is opaque to the caller, so a\nstore is free to use a dense counter, a packed locator, or anything else\nit can later resolve in [`take`](PageStore::take).",
